Phase 4:
Cross-browser config — already set up in your playwright.config.ts, tests run on Chrome, Firefox, and WebKit automatically. 
Screenshot on failure — add this to your config:
typescriptuse: {
  screenshot: 'only-on-failure',
  video: 'retain-on-failure',
}
Now when a test fails, Playwright automatically saves a screenshot and video. This shows you think about debugging, not just passing tests.